ck down to feet. No head, face, hair, ears.\n- Dividers: one thin straight vertical line between left portrait and right panel; two additional thin vertical lines within the right panel separating front/side/back.\n- Lighting: unified professional studio lighting, soft directional key light, natural shadow shaping.\n- Quality: realistic skin texture, accurate hair texture, garment material rendering; consistent studio lighting across the three views; realistic drape, folds, seams.\n- Identity preservation: match the reference image's face, hairstyle, body proportions, outfit, colors, materials.\n- Negative constraints: no head in the right panel; no text, watermarks, logos, labels, annotations, borders.\n\nThis is a Type B/C generation task — generating a new graphic (reference sheet) based on the subject reference image. Actually it's closer to Type C: generating from a subject reference image. But it's not an information-rich infographic; it's a reference sheet layout. The mandatory minimum length of 4000 characters"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 823, "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "type": "easy showAnything", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [408.2414245605469, 422.6795959472656], "pos": [2960.5654296875, 3310.523193359375], "id": 540, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-easy-use", "ver": "d9c2072a2de5f51ef9898ec50ccd4dda82e16126", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything", "ttNbgOverride": {"bgcolor": "#335", "groupcolor": "#88A", "color": "#223"}}, "order": 18}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#222", "widgets_values": ["Qwen Image 2.1 has native 2K (2048*2048) support for direct output.\n\nDefault (custom_size off): output follows image_1's aspect ratio, scaled to about resolution*resolution (default 1024, multiple of 32). This is not image_1's original pixel size. Set 